#### Connecting Gladly to Claude
About a minute, right in your Claude settings
1. 1In Claude, open Customize and choose Connectors (claude.ai or the desktop app).
2. 2Click +, choose Add custom connector, and paste your Gladly link as the remote MCP server URL.
3. 3Click Add and start a new chat. Ask for something real: Gladly is now part of your Claude.
Configuration · claude_desktop_config.jsonCopy
```
{
"mcpServers": {
"gladly-mcp": {
"url": "https://edge.vinkius.com/vk_preview_03uR9xTUvWnqJpjKpskEEGk3YezNOqopK12xAt0P/mcp"
}
}
}
```

#### Connecting Gladly to ChatGPT
About a minute, right in your ChatGPT settings
1. 1In ChatGPT, open Settings, choose Apps & Connectors, and turn on Developer mode under Advanced settings.
2. 2Click Create, name it, and paste your Gladly link as the MCP server URL. Choose No authentication and check “I trust this application”.
3. 3Create it, start a new chat, and switch the connector on via the + menu. Ask for something real: Gladly is now part of your ChatGPT.
