#### Connecting Gladly to Gemini
About a minute, right in your terminal
1. 1Open the Gemini CLI in your terminal.
2. 2Run: gemini mcp add --transport http Gladly <your link>. Your Gladly link above is the HTTP URL.
3. 3Run /mcp and confirm the status shows CONNECTED. Gladly is now part of your Gemini.

{
